        "title": "Preparing for Winter",
        "text": "Autumn was coming and Nutti knew he had to collect nuts for the winter. But how many nuts would he really need?"
      },
      "3": {
        "title": "The Power of Multiplication Tables",
        "text": "Nutti remembered that his grandmother had taught him multiplication tables. 'If you collect 7 nuts a day for 8 days, how many will you have in total?' grandma had asked."
      },
      "4": {
        "title": "The Adventure Begins",
        "text": "Nutti decided he would learn all the multiplication tables perfectly. This way he could quickly calculate how many nuts he would have at any time!"
